--- frame
hello
!world
z
longer
C-o save  C-x C-c quit  C-g hide
demo.txt * 2:7
--- lines
["hello" "!world" "z" "longer"]
quit? true  modified? true
--- frame at 2 rows
!world
demo.txt * 2:7
--- geometry as the height collapses
rows 3  text-rows 1  help true  scroll-row 1  cursor-row 1
rows 2  text-rows 1  help false  scroll-row 1  cursor-row 1
rows 1  text-rows 1  help false  scroll-row 1  cursor-row 1
--- frame at 10 rows, buffer of 4
hello
!world
z
longer




C-o save  C-x C-c quit  C-g hide
demo.txt * 2:7
frame lines 10 for 10 rows
--- frame at 5 columns
hello
!wor>
z
long>
C-o >
demo>
widths [5 5 1 5 5 5] (each must be 5 or less)
clip 1 [>]  clip 0 []
--- horizontal scroll, 36 chars through a 12-column window
col 0  scroll 0  screen 0  on-screen  [0123456789a>]
col 11  scroll 0  screen 11  on-screen  [0123456789a>]
col 12  scroll 1  screen 11  on-screen  [<23456789ab>]
col 20  scroll 9  screen 11  on-screen  [<abcdefghij>]
col 36  scroll 25  screen 11  on-screen  [<qrstuvwxyz]
--- wrapped frame, 12 columns
0123456789ab
cdefghijklmn
opqrstuvwxyz

tail

C-o save  C>
d.txt 1:1
--- wrapped cursor
col 0  screen-row 0  screen-col 0  on-screen
col 11  screen-row 0  screen-col 11  on-screen
col 12  screen-row 1  screen-col 0  on-screen
col 25  screen-row 2  screen-col 1  on-screen
col 36  screen-row 3  screen-col 0  on-screen
--- wrapped down/up move screen rows, not buffer rows
start          row 0  col 25
after down     row 0  col 36
after down     row 1  col 1
after down     row 1  col 1
onto line 2    row 1  col 1
back up        row 0  col 36
unwrapped      row 0  col 3
after down     row 1  col 3
